#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:15
msgid ""
"This tool provides two main functions: starting the Clash service and "
"managing the configuration file. The ``run`` command starts the Clash "
"service by running ``sudo ./clash -d ./`` in the script directory, while "
"the ``config`` command helps manage the ``config.yaml`` file."
msgstr "此工具提供两个主要功能：启动 Clash 服务和管理配置文件。``run`` 命令通过在脚本目录中运行 ``sudo ./clash -d ./`` 来启动 Clash 服务，而 ``config`` 命令帮助管理 ``config.yaml`` 文件。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:17
