#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:34
msgid ""
"This command starts the Clash service by running ``sudo ./clash -d ./`` "
"in the script directory. It automatically changes to the correct "
"directory and ensures Clash runs with the proper configuration."
msgstr "此命令通过在脚本目录中运行 ``sudo ./clash -d ./`` 来启动 Clash 服务。它自动切换到正确的目录并确保 Clash 使用正确的配置运行。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:37
msgid "Automatically changes to the correct directory"
msgstr "自动切换到正确的目录"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:38
msgid "Runs Clash with sudo privileges"
msgstr "使用 sudo 权限运行 Clash"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:39
msgid "Uses the current directory as the configuration directory"
msgstr "使用当前目录作为配置目录"

