#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:65
msgid ""
"This command helps manage the ``config.yaml`` file. By default, it "
"displays the absolute path of the configuration file. With the ``--edit``"
" option, it opens the file in your default editor."
msgstr "此命令帮助管理 ``config.yaml`` 文件。默认情况下，它显示配置文件的绝对路径。使用 ``--edit`` 选项，它会在您的默认编辑器中打开文件。"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:68
msgid "Display configuration file absolute path"
msgstr "显示配置文件绝对路径"

#: ../../source/clash_tools/clash_serve.rst:69
msgid "Open configuration file in editor"
msgstr "在编辑器中打开配置文件"

